Title: Spatial Network Kernel
Version: 2.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Tom", "Russell", email = "tomalrussell@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The array kernel of the 'snkit' spatial networks toolkit: finding
